{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A grandma has lost her cat.</strong><br><strong>You are John Parkour.</strong><br><strong>Time to climb.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chase the mischievous &quot;John Cat&quot; across floating islands and absurd obstacles in this short, funky, and fast-paced first-person parkour adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master momentum and unlock wild new movement abilities like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magnet Dash</strong> \u2013 zip through the air to magnetic orbs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/Magnet.gif?t=1745408171\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sling Gun</strong> \u2013 shoot mid-air switches to reveal paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/Sling.gif?t=1745408171\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Double Jump</strong> \u2013 reach new heights and correct your flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/DoubleJump.gif?t=1745408171\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grapple</strong> \u2013 swing between objects like a spider</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/Grapple.gif?t=1745408171\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026and upgrades to your existing abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn't a rage game\u2014checkpoints are placed throughout the level, and the game features aim assist to keep the flow smooth and fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedrun-focused first-person platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable abilities that evolve your movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reflex-based challenges requiring precise timing and aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time trial mode with your ghost cat as the rival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generous checkpointing and aim assist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1\u20132 hours of tightly designed, high-energy gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built entirely by one person with love (and stupidity)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She just wanted her cat back.<br>Now you\u2019re a legend.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686450?t=1745408171","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686450?t=1745408171","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/6af6f3b0b5a6f065c5d935be97e9d4f16058059e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745408171","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/6af6f3b0b5a6f065c5d935be97e9d4f16058059e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745408171","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A grandma has lost her cat.</strong><br><strong>You are John Parkour.</strong><br><strong>Time to climb.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chase the mischievous &quot;John Cat&quot; across floating islands and absurd obstacles in this short, funky, and fast-paced first-person parkour adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master momentum and unlock wild new movement abilities like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magnet Dash</strong> \u2013 zip through the air to magnetic orbs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/Magnet.gif?t=1745408171\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sling Gun</strong> \u2013 shoot mid-air switches to reveal paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/Sling.gif?t=1745408171\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Double Jump</strong> \u2013 reach new heights and correct your flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/DoubleJump.gif?t=1745408171\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grapple</strong> \u2013 swing between objects like a spider</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/Grapple.gif?t=1745408171\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026and upgrades to your existing abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn't a rage game\u2014checkpoints are placed throughout the level, and the game features aim assist to keep the flow smooth and fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedrun-focused first-person platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable abilities that evolve your movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reflex-based challenges requiring precise timing and aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time trial mode with your ghost cat as the rival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generous checkpointing and aim assist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1\u20132 hours of tightly designed, high-energy gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built entirely by one person with love (and stupidity)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She just wanted her cat back.<br>Now you\u2019re a legend.</p>","developers":["HOLYPERSON"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"